{
  "_comment": [
    "Issue #11895: the step engine's state -> step classifier (design #11894, §4.1),",
    "pinned once for loom-daemon's work_finder::step_item::classify",
    "(loom-daemon/src/work_finder/step_item_tests.rs) and for a TypeScript twin to come.",
    "Each case's `inputs` deserialize directly into step_item::Inputs; `expected` is the",
    "classified item list in order: issue items by issue number, then PR-only items by PR",
    "number. `lane` defaults to \"normal\" and `send_back` to false.",
    "Park kinds, merged-link kinds, merge-queue membership and markers are computed by the",
    "caller (from the body parsers and trusted comments); the classifier never reads the forge."
  ],
